a cosmic revamp, but will this project soar or be lost in space?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixvfeYQPAfaTjn5PNRDetCrvJNa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-07\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Comfort Zone\",\"overview\":\"Don't throw out the good with the bad. It's a tricky one for Larissa as she tries to turn a comfy, much-loved sofa into something cool.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/svZytxEKVmCT3xpwea5MvVudHo1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Beans! Beans! Good for the Art?\",\"overview\":\"Beans?! New presenter Rob Bent is stunned by Rupert's risky plan to save a kitchen unit with baked-bean tins.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y6CUUu17yRlkXzEEeYrKAMiGH2a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-09\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Hiding to Nothing?\",\"overview\":\"When Jacqui finds leather hides, she thinks that 'high end' is the only way to go and that Uzo is the only man for the job.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cP04OVBO16GguCQRgCh1IvtLl93.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Mirror, Mirror on the Wall...\",\"overview\":\"Who can write the catchiest slogan of them all? Sarah Moore turns to sardines for inspiration, while Bruce goes for a pink rethink on some kitchen units.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bCHodGa0J2K1oOAUuhQPlsDoYjX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-14\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Wardrobe Malfunction?\",\"overview\":\"In Buckinghamshire, Jacqui Joseph explores High Wycombe Recycling Centre, determined to save quality items from being crushed. It's a high-stakes first for Simion, upholstering a wardrobe, while Jacqui retunes a TV unit for the modern market. But will it get a good reception?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7OMQLOWkaktAhymgpdDS8xrjRux.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Mental Block\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore has got bedsheets, block-printing dreams and scissors, but in this game, you need to know when to change the plan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/druLj4YzurzuBfH0VPiCE2J1gED.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Chair Rescue\",\"overview\":\"Jacqui Joseph is at High Wycombe Recycling Centre in Buckinghamshire, with an eagle eye, hoping to swoop in on quality items before they are lost for ever. Upholsterer Ollie takes radical action by knocking off 'ears', and Hannah turns to flower power for a sewing box in need of some TLC.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l9IemwTOI4dBLeqAKwXMT4OEXSK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-17\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-09-07\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}